WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.140 --> 00:00:02.100
Garson: Welcome, please come in.

2
00:00:02.180 --> 00:00:03.310
Mesut & Şenol: Thank you.

3
00:00:03.620 --> 00:00:05.110
Garson: What would you like?

4
00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:07.150
Şenol: Can we see the menu first?

5
00:00:09.640 --> 00:00:11.950
Garson: Of course. Here is our menu.

6
00:00:12.160 --> 00:00:13.290
Şenol: Thanks.

7
00:00:17.220 --> 00:00:18.790
Garson: Have you decided, sir?

8
00:00:20.280 --> 00:00:24.090
Mesut: I want lentil soup, chicken, and rice.

9
00:00:24.780 --> 00:00:27.670
Şenol: I want tomato soup and döner.

10
00:00:28.340 --> 00:00:30.170
Şenol: Let's also get a salad to share.

11
00:00:32.220 --> 00:00:35.390
Garson: Certainly, sir. What would you like to drink?

12
00:00:35.700 --> 00:00:36.500
Mesut: I'll have ayran.

13
00:00:36.500 --> 00:00:39.270
Şenol: Make mine orange juice.

14
00:00:41.800 --> 00:00:44.030
Garson: Would you also like dessert after the meal?

15
00:00:44.280 --> 00:00:45.910
Garson: We have very nice desserts.

16
00:00:47.880 --> 00:00:49.170
Mesut: What desserts do you have?

17
00:00:49.300 --> 00:00:51.750
Garson: We have baklava, rice pudding, and kadayıf.

18
00:00:52.440 --> 00:00:55.140
Mesut: Let's have one portion of baklava each after the meal.

19
00:00:55.220 --> 00:00:56.550
Mesut: With tea on the side.

20
00:00:56.700 --> 00:00:59.510
Garson: Alright, sir. I'll bring your orders right away.

21
00:01:00.560 --> 00:01:04.650
Garson: Yes. These are yours. And these are yours.

22
00:01:05.040 --> 00:01:06.490
Garson: Enjoy your meal, sir.

23
00:01:09.840 --> 00:01:11.750
Mesut: Waiter, the bill please!

24
00:01:14.310 --> 00:01:16.160
Garson: Here you go.

25
00:01:19.380 --> 00:01:20.850
Mesut: Keep the change.

26
00:01:21.020 --> 00:01:22.050
Garson: Thanks.

